<title>SPAIN: Spanish Q3 average earnings up 4.6pct year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Spanish Q3 average earnings up 4.6pct year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average wages in Spain per worker per month rose 4.6 percent year-on-year in the third quarter, the National Statistics Institute INE said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the second quarter average earnings also rose 4.6 percent versus the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>The average Spanish wage was 210,954 pesetas per month in the third quarter.</p>
<p>By sector, wages rose 5.3 percent year-on-year in industry, 4.8 percent in construction, and 3.5 percent in services, INE said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
